 of coins","Can absorb nearby <Vapidity> or <Sapidity> to regain 1 gold coin"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":20000,"atk":1600,"def":1000,"res":20,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":3}},"scantwords":{"slug":"scantwords","name":"Scantwords","icon":"/enemies-icons/Scantwords.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A Waregeist that manifested when it was infected by Sui-Xiang. Beauty is in the eye of the beholder. A Waregeist of this type can show its opponent their inner secrets in their most relentless, truest form, and is more likely to anger its opponents than other Waregeists.","abilities":["More likely to be attacked by allied units","Spawns 1 <Brass Mirror> when defeated"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.8,"stats":{"hp":8000,"atk":900,"def":900,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":4}},"unmoving_lazy":{"slug":"unmoving_lazy","name":"Unmoving 'Lazy'","icon":"/enemies-icons/Unmoving 'Lazy'.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A majestic Ink Spirit named by the painter herself. Looks weird, just like it's carrying a mountain on its back. As still as a mountain when not moving, but bears down on its enemies like boulders tumbling down a mountain when in a team. Can draw enemies to attack it, unfathomably tough.","abilities":["More likely to be targeted by attacks."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":18000,"atk":800,"def":1300,"res":60,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3.8}},"pseudomut":{"slug":"pseudomut","name":"Pseudomut","icon":"/enemies-icons/Pseudomut.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPos